      "side": 1,
      "message": "the number of dead pixels reported by vendors is `unit32_t`:\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/release-firmware/fpmcu-dartmonkey/ec/driver/fingerprint/fpc/libfp/fpc_private.h;l\u003d131?q\u003dfp_sensor_info_t\u0026start\u003d11#:~:text\u003d130-,131,-132\n\nSo I believe we should be able to handle that. However, if we reach more than 1000 dead pixels, I am sure the sensor is useless.",
